Manage preflight

Usage:
  bootwright preflight [command]

Available Commands:
  add-ons           Check add-on prerequisites (unavailable)
  all               Check all prerequisites (unavailable)
  clusters          Check selected cluster readiness (unavailable)
  container-cluster Check ContainerCluster readiness (unavailable)
  controller        Check controller prerequisites
  infra             Check infrastructure readiness (unavailable)
  storage-cluster   Check StorageCluster readiness (unavailable)

Global Flags:
      --context string             Select a context (default: current context)
  -h, --help                       Show help for this command
      --ssh-ask-sudo-password      Request the borrowed account's sudo password
      --ssh-id-file string         Offer an explicit private key for eligible SSH access
      --ssh-user string            Borrow an explicit POSIX account for eligible SSH access
      --ssh-user-for-provisioned   Extend the borrowed account to provisioned machines

Use "bootwright preflight [command] --help" for more information about a command.
